// L7 app terminations (docs/specs/round-1.md#signals): per app and bin, a container killed with exit code 137
// (out of memory), a crash loop: at least MinExited "ProcessExited" events and at least MinRestarts containers "main"
// created (one restart alone writes 3 to 9 exit records, docs/specs/round-6.md#1-l7-counts-restarts), or at least
// MinProbeKills containers killed by Azure after failed health probes (the 2026-08-20 and 09-09 kills: workers all
// busy, the probe timed out).
// Parameters: Apps, MinExited, MinRestarts, MinProbeKills, Start, End, BinSize.
ContainerAppSystemLogs_CL
| where TimeGenerated between (Start .. End) and ContainerAppName_s in~ (Apps)
| summarize OomKills = countif(Log_s has "exit code '137'"), Exited = countif(Reason_s == "ProcessExited"),
    Restarts = countif(Reason_s == "ContainerCreated" and Log_s has "'main'"),
    ProbeKills = countif(Reason_s == "ContainerTerminated" and Log_s has "reason 'ProbeFailure'")
    by App = ContainerAppName_s, Bin = bin_at(TimeGenerated, BinSize, Start)
| where OomKills > 0 or (Exited >= MinExited and Restarts >= MinRestarts) or ProbeKills >= MinProbeKills
| project Bin, App, OomKills, Exited, Restarts, ProbeKills
